OL,3,AZambia signs US health deal after
OL,4,Adisputes over data-sharing
OL,5,
OL,6,FZambia has signed a five-year health
OL,7,Ffinancing agreement with the US, ending
OL,8,Fmonths of public dispute over whether
OL,9,Fthe country was trading citizens'
OL,10,Fmedical data and mineral rights for
OL,11,Faid.
OL,13,FUnder the memorandum of understanding,
OL,14,Fsigned in Lusaka on Thursday along with
OL,15,Fa data-sharing deal, the US will
OL,16,Fprovide about $1.5bn (#1.1bn), with
OL,17,FZambia also contributing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
