OL,3,AZambia signs US health deal after
OL,4,Adisputes over data-sharing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCivil society groups had criticised a
OL,7,Fleaked draft they said allowed too much
OL,8,Fdata sharing, while activists seized on
OL,9,Freports that health money was being
OL,10,Flinked to preferential access for US
OL,11,Fcompanies to minerals, which the
OL,12,Fthen-US ambassador denied.
OL,14,FThe deal comes after the US Agency for
OL,15,FInternational Development (USAID) was
OL,16,Fcut.
